Elysian Player - Third-Party Notices
=====================================

This application links FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) libraries as part of its
native video engine (native/elysian_video). Specifically, the shipped
engine links only:

    avformat, avcodec, avutil, swscale, swresample

all decode/demux-side libraries used for playback. The engine does NOT
link libx264, libx265, or any other GPL-only encoder library, and does not
encode media of any kind; none of that code is needed to play a file back,
which is all this application does with FFmpeg.

