Reproducibility note
---------------------
BUILD_EXE.bat downloads FFmpeg from a "latest" release tag that moves
forward as the upstream project publishes new builds, which is convenient
for a one-click build but means two builds run months apart may not link
against byte-identical FFmpeg binaries. For a build you need to reproduce
exactly or audit precisely, either:

  - pin FFMPEG_ZIP_URL in BUILD_EXE.bat to a specific dated release tag
    (e.g. an "autobuild-YYYY-MM-DD-HH-MM" tag) instead of "latest", or
  - place your own pre-verified LGPL shared FFmpeg build at
    third_party\ffmpeg yourself; BUILD_EXE.bat uses it as-is and skips
    the download whenever that folder already contains
    include\libavformat\avformat.h.

